    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "General Title is provided by FSg Archives staff based on Alastair Northedge's publication, \"An Interpretation of the Palace of the Caliph at Samarra (Dar Al-Khilafa or Jawsaq Al-Khaqani). In Ars Orientalis, Vol. 23.\"" ;
