    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Handwritten notes reads, \"[Locations of aerial photography taken by G. A. Beazeley in 1917]; in red: F24, F252, F26, F27, F28, F29, F30, F31, F32, F33, F34, F35, F36, F37, F38, F39, F40, F41, and F42; in blue: G1, G2, G3, G4, G5, G6, G7, G8, G9, G10, G11, G12; in green: H30, H31, H32, H33, H34, H35, H36, H41, H42, H43.\"" ;
