    rdf:value "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note Transliteration on drawing paper related primarly to the excavation of Persepolis, initiated by Ernst Herzfeld in early March 1931, under the auspices of the Oriental Institute of the University of Chicago. Herzfeld left Persepolis permanently in Spring 1934." ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:OddNote .

