    rdf:value "Scope and Contents Additional information from Roland G. Kent's 1953 publication reads, \"DPf = Darius, Persepolis F: Elamite, 24 lines, on the south retaining wall of the palace.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

