    crm:P2_has_type mbs:ScopeContent ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:eng ;
    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Original caption in English reads, \"Appliqué Slip No.2 to T.C. 97(B). Samarrah. Dated 31-3-1918. Samarrah. Scale 1 inch to 1 mile. Compiled from 6th Survey by survey Party M.E.F. in February and March 1918, north of the Tigris, and from sketches by Corps and Survey Party M.E.F. south of the Tigris.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

