    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note Ernst Herzfeld first visited Bisutun in early August 1913 while on an expedition from Sāmarrāʼ (Iraq) to Asadābād (Hamadān, Iran). Finally, additional visits to Bisutun (Iran) were carried out by Ernst Herzfeld in early June 1923 and 1924." ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:OddNote .

