    crm:P2_has_type mbs:OddNote ;
    rdf:value "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note Map related primarly to an expedition to Palmyra (Syria), carried out by Moritz Sobernheim in 1899, when he photographed and made squeezes of some of the inscriptions. A few years later, while in Berlin, Ernst Herzfeld collaborated with M. Sobernheim by drafting architectural plans for the 1905 expedition to Baalbeck.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:OddNote .

