    rdf:value "Scope and Contents Naqsh-i Rustam (Iran): Sasanian Reliefs Depicting the Equestrian Combat of King Bahram II, Traced from a Drawing by James Morier [drawing]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

