    rdf:value "Scope and Contents Excavation of Samarra (Iraq): Congregational Mosque of Madinat al-Mutawakkiliyya (Abu Dulaf Mosque): Plan of the Mosque and Ziyada [drawing]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

