    rdf:value "Scope and Contents Additional information reads, \"Ṣūr ʿĪṣā belongs to the group of large buildings within the ruin that Herzfeld did not excavate in 1911-1912 for lack of time, though he did make tracings from the remains still visible on the ground.\" [Leisten, Thomas, 2003: \"Excavation of Samarra, v. I. Architecture : Final report of the first campaign 1910-1912. Verlag Philipp von Zabern, Mainz am Rhein, 2003. p.112.\"]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

