        "Local Numbers D-332 FSA A.06 05.0332",
        "Scope and Contents - Sketchbook in Ernst Herzfeld Papers: SK-33, p.11.",
        "Scope and Contents Ma'arat al-Nu'man (Syria): Great Mosque: Door of Dar al-Fukara [drawing]" ;
