        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten caption on verso reads, \"Sad Sutūn, 1:200.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten number, probably by Joseph Upton, reads, \"D-861.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Sketchbook in Ernst Herzfeld Papers: SK-22, p.41 to 53.",
        "Scope and Contents Excavation of Persepolis (Iran): Throne Hall: Ground Plan Showing Columns Location inside the Hundred-Column Hall [drawing]" ;
