    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement Drawings are arranged roughly in sequential number sequences, housed in document boxes or in flat file folders by size, and stored in the map case drawers.",
        "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note Drawing related to a trial excavation in the Summer 1928 undertook by Ernst Herzfeld as well as a campaign of excavation at the western mound, Tall-i-Bakun A under the auspice of the Oriental Institute of the University of Chicago, carried out by Alexander Langsdorff under Ernst Herzfeld's direction between March 25, 1932 and July 21, 1932.",
        "Local Numbers D-410 D-411 D-412 FSA A.06 05.0410 FSA A.06 05.0411 FSA A.06 05.0412",
        "Scope and Contents Additional information reads, \"Drawings D-410, D-411, D-412 (water-colors) are mounted on mat numbered Pl.XXXVII.\"",
        "Scope and Contents Original title on verso reads, \"Tafel XXXVII.\"" ;
